    },
    {
      "source": "Constructs a <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> based on the given <code>content</code>, <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/LongSupplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>LongSupplier</code></a> applying\noptimizations. The construction of <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> omits a count query if the total can be determined based on the\nresult size and <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<code>content</code>、<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Pageable</code></a>以及应用优化的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/LongSupplier.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>LongSupplier</code></a>构建一个<a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Page</code></a>。如果可以根据结果大小和<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Pageable</code></a>确定总数，则构建<code>Page</code>时会省略计数查询。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Constructs a <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> based on the given <code>content</code>, <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/LongSupplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>LongSupplier</code></a> applying\noptimizations.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <code>content</code>、<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/LongSupplier.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>LongSupplier</code></a>，构建一个经过优化的 <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Support for query execution using <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>. Using <a href=\"PageableExecutionUtils.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.support\"><code>PageableExecutionUtils</code></a> assumes that data queries\nare cheaper than <code>COUNT</code> queries and so some cases can take advantage of optimizations.",
      "translation": "支持使用<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>执行查询。使用<a href=\"PageableExecutionUtils.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.support\"><code>PageableExecutionUtils</code></a>假设数据查询比<code>COUNT</code>查询更便宜，因此在某些情况下可以利用优化。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
