    {
      "source": "<h1 class=\"title\" title=\"Class PageableExecutionUtils\">Class PageableExecutionUtils</h1>",
      "translation": "<h1 class=\"title\" title=\"类 PageableExecutionUtils\">类 PageableExecutionUtils</h1>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Core",
      "translation": "Spring Data 核心",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Modifier and Type",
      "translation": "修改类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>content</code> - result of a query with applied <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>. The list must not be null and must\n         contain up to <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a> items.</dd>\n<dd><code>pageable</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>totalSupplier</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>content</code></a> and a total size.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>content</code> - 应用了 <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 的查询结果。该列表不能为 null，且最多包含 <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a> 个元素。</dd>\n<dd><code>pageable</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>totalSupplier</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>针对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>content</code></a> 的总大小和总页数的 <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a>。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
